  "description": "Alisa Benin has loved stories since her days at the Academy, so when she finds herself magically transported into the entries of her new diary, she gives the prince a story to soothe his tears. In these entries, Emperor Louis Ferdinando II is but a child, looking for friends. But in the present, Louis is perplexed by Alisa. Just who is this woman who has entered his dreams and, in doing so, altered his past? As Alisa comes to his aid, Louis will have to decide: Is this fairy friend or foe?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
